---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Me - d4str3k" description="Cybersecurity evaluator and security researcher working on product security, Android, IoT, embedded systems and Web/API assessments.">
  <div class="page">
    <h1>About me</h1>
    <p>
      I am a Cybersecurity Evaluator and Security Researcher focused on product security, penetration testing and vulnerability assessment, with hands-on experience across mobile, IoT, embedded and web/API environments.
    </p>

    <p>
      In my current role, I perform security evaluations of commercial products and contribute to cybersecurity certification projects, including mobile security assessments and evaluations against industry standards such as ISO/IEC 60601-4-5.
    </p>

    <p>
      I am particularly interested in offensive security, vulnerability research and security testing of embedded and mobile systems. I have worked on the development of vulnerable training platforms such as <strong>VulnMNO</strong> and <strong>VulnZoo</strong>.
    </p>

    <p>
      My technical interests include Android security, IoT and embedded security, Web/API security, networking, Linux and low-level programming with C/C++, as well as Python-based security tooling.
    </p>
        <div class="profile-links">
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/maximo-garcia-aroca/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="profile-link linkedin">
        <img src="/linkedin.svg" alt="" width="48" height="48" />
        LinkedIn
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/d4str3k" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="profile-link github">
        <img src="/github.svg" alt="" width="48" height="48" />
        GitHub
      </a>
      <span class="profile-link tryhackme">
        <iframe src="https://tryhackme.com/api/v2/badges/public-profile?userPublicId=216822" title="d4str3k on TryHackMe" loading="lazy"></iframe>
      </span>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:2em;">
      Search <strong>d4str3k</strong> user on
      <a href="https://www.hackthebox.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hack The Box</a>
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:2em;">CVE</h2>
    <div class="cv-actions">
      <a href="/cv/CVE.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="profile-link">Open in new tab</a>
      <a href="/cv/CVE.pdf" download class="profile-link">Download PDF</a>
    </div>
    <object data="/cv/CVE.pdf" type="application/pdf" class="cv-viewer">
      <p>Your browser can't display the PDF inline. <a href="/cv/CVE.pdf">Download it here</a>.</p>
    </object>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: left;
    width: 100%;
  }
    .profile-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 2em 0 1em 0;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .profile-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5em;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 1.1em;
    background: #232323;
    padding: 0.5em 1em;
    border-radius: 8px;
    transition: background 0.2s;
    min-width: 0;
    overflow: visible;
  }

.profile-link img {
  width: 48px;
  height: 48px;
  display: inline-block;
  min-width: 48px;
  min-height: 48px;
  max-width: 48px;
  max-height: 48px;
  object-fit: contain;
  background: none;
  border: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0;
}
  .profile-link:hover {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #181818;
  }
  .profile-link.tryhackme {
    padding: 0;
    width: min(350px, 100%);
    background: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .profile-link.tryhackme iframe {
    vertical-align: middle;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 350px;
    height: 80px;
    border: none;
    overflow: visible;
    display: block;
  }
  .cv-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1em 0;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .cv-viewer {
    width: 100%;
    height: 80vh;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
</style>